{"id": "EUVD-2026-101124", "enisaUuid": "1b2af821-bced-3640-bb6b-2736170d8063", "description": "util-linux is a random collection of Linux utilities. In util-linux 2.17 through 2.41.6 and 2.42 through 2.42.3, and in 2.42.4 when the legacy `mount(2)` path is used without `/proc`, restricted non-root `mount` requests validate an `/etc/fstab` target before the mount operation re-resolves that pathname. A local low-privileged user authorized by an fstab `user` or `users` entry whose target has an attacker-writable ancestor can use `renameat2(RENAME_EXCHANGE)` to swap a path component and redirect an authorized mount to a root-owned location, such as mounting attacker-controlled content over `/etc/sudoers.d`, and thereby gain root privileges. Versions 2.41.5 and 2.42.2 pin targets for the new mount API, and 2.42.4 pins legacy targets through `/proc/self/fd`; the documented legacy fallback without `/proc` remains affected.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:52:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T15:08:26", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/security/advisories/GHSA-8gj5-72r3-428g", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/0b010025a0e429bc80355c94db86a843395d49e2", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/0d3d55975aa3492c62fd345eac38f41cd166c0b0", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/2c773f336134acf016e639abb6f12ba7341fe4b8", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/39fef62bf3226abb6bb018fa8750afa0327e84b4", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/472cc3fb2d4d47cca7aab2e0b59eb3fb8a9359ec", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/646fb66603d10a7ac337e14f566f1af48e3107c9", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/708d1b3c51932dc5ba8082c7368187715e6a8d78", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/78a860982e036f38fe9c0b3344998df5ac2c2ff5", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/85d16b341f7232c9dbb4884b632e1e956584bee9", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/a9508d216eb8977979102782672e0470cc9bf2a2", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/releases/tag/v2.41.5", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/releases/tag/v2.42.2", "https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/releases/tag/v2.42.4"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-53613"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1391863e-1084-3526-8a99-717f33b71466", "product": {"name": "util-linux", "vendor": {"name": "util-linux"}}, "product_version": "2.42, \u2264 2.42.4"}, {"id": "703899b4-f392-3f13-b767-51a277cdceb5", "product": {"name": "util-linux", "vendor": {"name": "util-linux"}}, "product_version": "2.17, \u2264 2.41.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fd211346-7507-3e11-920d-f4d3029cb042", "vendor": {"name": "util-linux"}}], "isExploited": false}